    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d953-a2">

                <pb facs="1100" n="1020" xml:id="pg1020"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr. Gargiulo.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-01-19"><hi rendition="#italic">January 19,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Trust you will be able to modify demands, but as I have entire confidence in the
                    committee, lose no time in concluding agreement on best terms possible, and
                    advise me when, how, and where you wish money sent.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leishman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
